Package: furus
Version: 0.1.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: furus maintainers <mohamadzadeh@outlook.com>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: ntfs-3g, e2fsprogs, udftools, libwim15
Description: native USB image writer for Linux
 Write disk images to USB devices with a native writer. FAT32 and exFAT are
 written natively; an optional root-owned D-Bus helper mediates device access.
 NTFS, ext2/3/4, UDF and WIM/ESD images need the recommended external tools
 (ntfs-3g, e2fsprogs, udftools and libwim15) available at write time.
